      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785290026112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "They are independent if P(X = x, Y = y) = P(X = x) * P(Y = y)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "They are independent if P(X = x, Y = y) = P(X = x) * P(Y = y)",
